ero unnecessary dependencies','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1359,'en','settings','ds_pillar1_item3','Clean URL router supporting dynamic segment parameters and middleware pipelines','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1360,'en','settings','ds_pillar1_item4','100% PDO prepared statements for absolute SQL injection prevention','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1361,'en','settings','ds_pillar1_item5','Multi-layered security guards (Rate Limiting, CSRF, 2FA, Remote Session Revocation)','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1362,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_title','Extensible Modular Foundation','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1363,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_sub','Pluggable Architecture for Enterprise Extensions','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1364,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_item1','Granular RBAC role and permission matrix structured by module and action (module:action)','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1365,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_item2','Live JSON field-level change tracking (audit_logs) comparing old and new values','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1366,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_item3','Bilingual dictionary (TH/EN) stored in MySQL with real-time in-app translation editor','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1367,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_item4','YouTube-style top progress bar with Chromium Paint-Holding FOUC prevention','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-27 04:39:21'),(1368,'en','settings','ds_pillar2_item5','Instantly extensible to POS, E-Commerce, CRM, HR, Inventory, or Restaurant systems','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1369,'en','settings','ds_golden_rules_title','4 Golden Architecture Principles','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1370,'en','settings','ds_rule1_title','1. Zero Raw ID Exposure','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1371,'en','settings','ds_rule1_desc','Never expose numeric primary keys. All IDs must be masked into 8-character Hashids.','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1372,'en','settings','ds_rule2_title','2. Instant Load & Zero FOUC','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1373,'en','settings','ds_rule2_desc','Render client-side DataTables instantly with anti-flicker script in the head.','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1374,'en','settings','ds_rule3_title','3. Shared Hosting Ready','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1375,'en','settings','ds_rule3_desc','Runs seamlessly on cPanel / DirectAdmin / Apache .htaccess without requiring SSH.','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1376,'en','settings','ds_rule4_title','4. 100% Bilingual Parity','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1377,'en','settings','ds_rule4_desc','Thai (TH) and English (EN) language keys must be strictly 1:1 symmetric with 0 missing keys.','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1378,'en','settings','ds_tech_sub','Pure MVC Pipeline, Security Stack, Touchpoints & Real-Time Sync Layer','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1379,'en','settings','ds_th_layer','Layer','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1380,'en','settings','ds_th_tech','Tech & Libraries','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1381,'en','settings','ds_th_scope','Implementation & Scope','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1382,'en','settings','ds_flow_title','High-Level Architecture Flowchart','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1383,'en','settings','ds_flow1_title','1. Client Touchpoints','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1384,'en','settings','ds_flow1_desc','Web Desktop, Mobile Browser, Tablet, PWA & External API Consumers','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1385,'en','settings','ds_flow2_title','2. Security & Routing Layer','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1386,'en','settings','ds_flow2_desc','.htaccess -> Router -> Auth, RBAC, RateLimit & CSRF Middlewares','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1387,'en','settings','ds_flow3_title','3. Core Controllers & Services','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1388,'en','settings','ds_flow3_desc','Auth, Users, Roles, Logs, Settings, Profile, Hashids & Lang Services','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1389,'en','settings','ds_flow4_title','4. Persistence & Storage','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1390,'en','settings','ds_flow4_desc','MySQL InnoDB (12 Tables) + Storage (Error Logs, Uploads)','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1391,'en','settings','ds_dir_sub','Project Tree Structure & Coding Isolation Guidelines','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1392,'en','settings','ds_db_sub','Relational Database Model: 12 Core UMS Tables & Integrity Specifications','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1393,'en','settings','ds_table_roles','System user role groups (Superadmin, Admin, Manager, Staff, User)','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1394,'en','settings','ds_table_permissions','Fine-grained module and action permission definitions (module:action)','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1395,'en','settings','ds_table_role_permissions','Many-to-many relationship mapping connecting roles to permissions','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1396,'en','settings','ds_table_users','User accounts, hashed passwords, 2FA TOTP, Social OAuth, and active status','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1397,'en','settings','ds_table_user_sessions','Tracks live online sessions, device IP, User-Agent, and remote session revocation','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1398,'en','settings','ds_table_password_resets','Password reset tokens sent via email with expiration timestamp tracking','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1399,'en','settings','ds_table_activity_logs','Audit trail of general user activities and system logins','2026-10-26 15:41:24','2026-10-26 15:41:24'),(1400,'en','settings','ds_table_audit_logs